<title>ITALY: Italian total bank lending up 2.9 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Italian total bank lending up 2.9 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian total bank lending rose 2.9 percent year-on-year in July, the Bank of Italy said in a statement. It issued the following provisional year-on-year percentage changes:</p>
<p>			  July 1996   June 1996	July 1995</p>
<p>Total bank lending   +2.9%	  +2.7% (2.4)    +3.2%</p>
<p>Lira bank lending    +4.9%	  +5.4% (4.9)    +7.4%</p>
<p>Deposits		 +5.3%	  +5.2% (5.3)    -1.8x%</p>
<p>Note: Figures in brackets denote previously given data.</p>
</text>
